#: src/configuration-settings.md:164
msgid "Command Line"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuration-settings.md:166
msgid ""
"The default settings in `mk/config.mk` can be overridden by explicitly "
"setting them on the `make` command line."
msgstr ""

#: src/configuration-settings.md:168
msgid ""
"For example, the following command builds the `demo` image variant and loads "
"it into QEMU:"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuration-settings.md:174
msgid ""
"Some environment variables can also be set for the lifetime of the current "
"shell by setting them at the command line:"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuration-settings.md:177
msgid "i586"
msgstr ""

