"The Redox image can be customized by tweaking the configuration files at "
"`config/$ARCH/*.toml`. However, it is recommended that you create your own "
"configuration file and apply changes there. (The configuration files at "
"`config/$ARCH` can override the data type values from the filesystem "
"templates at `config`)"
msgstr ""

